{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ba5264c4-6f8a-51a5-b34e-dfc1eb6482c9", "source_ordinal": 810, "reading_ordinal": 3247, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "第一实践", "published_at": "2025-05-01T01:47:53.951000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/9671202917/answer/1901089964894168370"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "人皆有不忍人之心。先王有不忍人之心，斯有不忍人之政矣。以不忍人之心，行不忍人之政，治天下可运之掌上。所以谓人皆有不忍人之心者，今人乍见孺子将入于井，皆有怵惕恻隐之心。非所以内交于孺子之父母也，非所以要誉于乡党朋友也，非恶其声而然也。由是观之，无恻隐之心，非人也；无羞恶之心，非人也；无辞让之心，非人也；无是非之心，非人也。恻隐之心，仁之端也；羞恶之心，义之端也；辞让之心，礼之端也；是非之心，智之端也。人之有是四端也，犹其有四体也。有是四端而自谓不能者，自贼者也；谓其君不能者，贼其君者也。凡有四端于我者，知皆扩而充之矣，若火之始然，泉之始达。苟能充之，足以保四海；苟不充之，不足以事父母。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 295}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你的老师完全搞错了孟子这段话的性质。", "char_start": 296, "char_end": 314}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "孟子根本不是在“论证客观逻辑”，或者“尝试科学解释自然现象”，他是在立法。", "char_start": 315, "char_end": 352}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "“人皆有恻隐之心”成立的绝对依据，根本就不是“乍见孺子将入于井，皆有怵惕恻隐之心”，而是“无恻隐之心，非人也”。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 409}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "无恻隐之心，你就不是人，因为在我这里，“有恻隐之心”是人的鉴定标准，是内嵌在人的定义里的要素。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一个人自称是人而又同时自称没有恻隐之心——例如我直接逼问你“看到小孩掉井里你揪不揪心”， 你给我回答一个“老子没感觉”，那么你只会被做两种结论——", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 531}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "要么你真的没感觉，那你就是一头人形的畜生，披着人皮、口吐人言的鬼魅，你的“人”的身份即刻注销，你作为人的权利当即作废，从此时此刻起，人类因你似人而视你为极恶兽。", "char_start": 532, "char_end": 612}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "人人得而诛之。", "char_start": 613, "char_end": 620}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "要么，你是有感觉而不承认，也就是“有是四端而自谓不能者，自贼者也”——你想干什么？", "char_start": 621, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你想当王x蛋。", "char_start": 663, "char_end": 670}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这样，你还是一个人，乡亲们不至于把你当人形畜生直接打死，但也要把你当成准罪犯盯防起来。", "char_start": 671, "char_end": 714}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "其实谁有那么大精力一天到晚防着你，直接给你关起来，啥时候你洗心革面说老实话，啥时候再放你出来。", "char_start": 715, "char_end": 762}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "就这两种后果，要么就地正法，要么无期徒刑，你自己挑。", "char_start": 763, "char_end": 789}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我说“人皆有恻隐之心”，我话说完，谁赞成，谁反对？", "char_start": 791, "char_end": 816}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这一条不是论证出来的，而是我们这个社团处事的规矩。", "char_start": 817, "char_end": 842}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你就算真的是个畜生，只要你不想变成年货，你装也给我装出个人样来。", "char_start": 843, "char_end": 875}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "没有恻隐之心，你也给我装出恻隐之心。", "char_start": 876, "char_end": 894}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "没有廉耻、不懂礼让、没有是非，你就装。", "char_start": 895, "char_end": 914}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "装得大家看不出破绽，你就活。", "char_start": 915, "char_end": 929}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "装不及格，不好意思，最轻也是赶出去自生自灭——你这也就算享了本国“人皆有恻隐之心”的福了。", "char_start": 930, "char_end": 975}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "哪怕你是个活畜生，君子之于禽兽也，见其生，不忍见其死。", "char_start": 976, "char_end": 1003}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "算你走运，你就偷着乐去吧。", "char_start": 1004, "char_end": 1017}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "“人皆有恻隐之心”是先验的，是立法保障的，是靠“按这个规矩建立的国家才够有组织力、战斗力”来认证的。", "char_start": 1018, "char_end": 1068}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "举个“乍见孺子将入井”，只是让你形象的体会一下，根本就不是为了证明。", "char_start": 1069, "char_end": 1103}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "“人皆有恻隐之心”，是一个由政治需要而确立的主观信条——它是一种政治正确。", "char_start": 1104, "char_end": 1141}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "政治正确根本不跟你谈什么人证物证，它跟你谈的是“你是不是想亡国灭种”？", "char_start": 1142, "char_end": 1177}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这就像你要我跟你证明“好人有好报，恶人有恶报”，或者“人而无信，不知其可”。", "char_start": 1178, "char_end": 1216}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "我证明不了，我也没这个兴趣跟你证明，你就痛快说一句你信不信，你说不信我就踢你下船，你自己游回家，因为我——我们大伙儿——没兴趣跟不相信的人浪费任何精力纠缠。", "char_start": 1217, "char_end": 1295}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "能留在船上的只能是无条件支持这些结论的人。", "char_start": 1296, "char_end": 1317}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你有本事，就去找不信这些也能把船开到岸的人去。", "char_start": 1318, "char_end": 1341}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这不是靠什么逻辑推演的，就是靠赌命。", "char_start": 1342, "char_end": 1360}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "赌命才是检验真理的最高标准，因为它是第一实践。", "char_start": 1361, "char_end": 1384}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 32}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0468"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价孟子的论证逻辑？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032"], "summary": "围绕“第一实践”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人皆有不忍人之心。先王有不忍人之心，斯有不忍人之政矣。以不忍人之心，行不忍人之政，治天下可运之掌上。所以谓人皆有不忍人之心者，今人乍见孺子将入于井，皆有怵惕恻隐之心。非所以内交于孺子之父母也，非所以要誉于乡党朋友也，非恶其声而然也。由是观之，无恻隐之心，非人也；无羞恶之心，非人也；无辞让之心，非人也；无是非之心，非人也。恻隐之心，仁之端也；羞恶之心，义之端也”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人皆有不忍人之心。先王有不忍人之心，斯有不忍人之政矣。以不忍人之心，行不忍人之政，治天下可运之掌上。所以谓人皆有不忍人之心者，今人乍见孺子将入于井，皆有怵惕恻隐之心。非所以内交于孺子之父母也，非所以要誉于乡党朋友也，非恶其声而然也。由是观之，无恻隐之心，非人也；无羞恶之心，非人也；无辞让之心，非人也；无是非之心，非人也。恻隐之心，仁之端也；羞恶之心，义之端也", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 295, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "769dae61-3cde-557f-acb5-19fe2c738968", "source_ordinal": 809, "reading_ordinal": 3248, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "艰辛乎", "published_at": "2025-05-01T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/1e44659c206b11f09f7552540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你为什么觉得孩子未来人生路艰辛？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为你发现子女娇生惯养、软弱不堪，然而在技能糟糕的现状下却并不努力，基于这么糟糕的现状，你对ta的前途非常悲观。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "是吗？", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "所以你想要用“告知ta未来人生会很艰辛”为手段，推动孩子变得坚强一点、多学点有用的技能。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这看上去道理很通顺，对吧？", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但这个思路有两个漏洞。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 148}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "1）你怎么知道这样程度的无能和软弱一定会导致ta将来活不下去呢？", "char_start": 149, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "注意，这并不意味着我不同意你的看法——事实上我不但理解，甚至还很赞同你的估计——问题是我们都这么看，就等于这一定会是事实吗？", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "二十年前几乎所有人都觉得中国的GDP要追上日本起码还要二十年，几亿人的共识，也一样不等于事实，那么你我现在的共识，就一定意味着会成为事实吗？", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 315}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "注意——这是你尝试向子女灌输“这样你将来一定会很惨”这一判断时，你的子女一定会抓住的反驳。", "char_start": 316, "char_end": 361}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你就算不让ta说也没用，因为这个反驳足够有力，已经足够ta在内心中抵抗你的灌输。", "char_start": 362, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你是没法通过举例、计算、担保、强迫向ta确立这一认知的。", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "既然这个认知建立不起来，那么你指望这个认知建立后能带来的种种推动作用自然也就根本不会发生。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 477}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "ta就一句“我不信会这样”再加一句“真的这样我就死”，两句真言一念，你这计划的第一步就要落空。", "char_start": 478, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "2）恐惧并不能直接导致努力。", "char_start": 527, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "有坚强信心可以战胜的恐惧才会刺激努力。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "令人绝望的恐惧并不行。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 573}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这里举一个例子——古以色列周边全是可怕的强敌，埃及、亚述、巴比伦、波斯、希腊、罗马个个都曾席卷天下。", "char_start": 574, "char_end": 624}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "生活在三不管不毛之地的以色列人，无论怎么修建城墙、习练军事，都没有任何可能和这些投鞭足以断流、打遍天下无敌手的帝国抗衡。", "char_start": 625, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "ta们也每天恐惧敌人袭来，一夜之间家破人亡、沦为奴隶，惶惶不可终日。", "char_start": 686, "char_end": 720}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "以色列人因此变得卧薪尝胆、秣马厉兵、枕戈待旦了吗？", "char_start": 721, "char_end": 746}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "不，以色列人转头去搞了安息日。就是每周六不允许从事任何劳动，只能绝对休息，连站岗放哨都不允许的那个安息日。", "char_start": 747, "char_end": 800}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "整个民族都“躺平”了。", "char_start": 801, "char_end": 812}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你能战胜的困难，才会激发你的勇气；令你绝望的恐惧，只会刺激你及时行乐、逃避自欺。", "char_start": 813, "char_end": 853}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "现在问题来了——你要灌输的那个恐惧，如果是ta仍有信心可以解决的，那就没用；如果你一直加重宣传直到ta真的相信自己不可能逃脱这悲惨的命运了，ta并不会去努力，而会优先考虑及时行乐——即抓住一切碎片时间能玩一把是一把。", "char_start": 854, "char_end": 962}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "有这两条放在这里，你的方法是行不通的。这跟你的这个判断是否准确无关。", "char_start": 963, "char_end": 997}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "哪怕事后证明你真的说对了，你在现在就是无法通过这个手段解决问题。", "char_start": 998, "char_end": 1030}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "那么怎么才能解决问题呢？", "char_start": 1032, "char_end": 1044}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你忘了吗？“有信心战胜的挑战带来积极行动”。", "char_start": 1045, "char_end": 1067}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你要学会闭嘴不提什么“你这样下去没有希望”，而要高度谨慎的选择你相信子女可以战胜、而一开始ta一定会觉得有挑战的项目，循序渐进的培养ta对“最后我一定能战胜”的丰富体验，ta自然会从这么多体验里确认“其实很多第一眼会让我完全没主意、没头绪的挑战，我最后都能搞定”这个基本的认识。", "char_start": 1068, "char_end": 1207}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你要不断的通过“这个你一开始也觉得自己弄不出来，结果你最后搞出来了”“那个你觉得你根本打不过，结果你后来一样打过”这样的体验，把“我不知道怎么办，我很悲观”和“我最后会失败”之间的关联斩断。", "char_start": 1208, "char_end": 1303}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "要让ta基于大量的实际体验，对“一开始觉得很棘手的困难”建立近乎盲目的信心。", "char_start": 1304, "char_end": 1342}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "这样，你就总是可以借助“有信心战胜的困难会催生努力”的客观规律得到你想要的结果。", "char_start": 1343, "char_end": 1383}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "事实上，一旦你通过精心安排，建立了ta这种信心，即使ta还没什么大不了的技能，仅仅展现出这种“越难越兴奋”的气质，你对ta前途的焦虑和担忧都已经自然消散了。", "char_start": 1384, "char_end": 1462}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "不信你试试。", "char_start": 1463, "char_end": 1469}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 38}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0468"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么样才能让孩子明白未来人生之路的艰辛?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035"], "summary": "围绕“艰辛乎”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你为什么觉得孩子未来人生路艰辛？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你为什么觉得孩子未来人生路艰辛？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "90290e31-8cc2-553b-8dbd-68647627cfc0", "source_ordinal": 808, "reading_ordinal": 3249, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "需求表达困难", "published_at": "2025-05-03T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/bf6985e4221211f0946c52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当然要表达，不然对方都不知道你的需求，怎么爱你呢？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "关键在于你要区分你是在提自己的需求，还是在请对方履行承诺的义务。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "举个例子——对方答应你晚上七点来接你，没来，你提出请对方以后不要迟到并要求对方做出某种回应来修复你对此后ta不守信的忧虑。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 120}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这在形式上是一种需求，但这因为涉及到对方承诺的义务，它就有别于其他的需求，而是一种你有权作出的追索。对方如果不认账，甚至发动报复，你是有责备、降级关系的合理立场的。", "char_start": 121, "char_end": 203}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但如果是对方没有承诺过的诉求，那就要走另一个伦理路线，就是无论对方是否应承、是否做到，你都不能抱怨。", "char_start": 204, "char_end": 254}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为你自己才是你自己需求的天然责任人，所以你本来就是在尝试将自己的义务转嫁给别人。转嫁成功，那恭喜你；转嫁未成功，你并没有受到任何损失，自然也没有任何人对你产生任何赔偿义务，你也自然没有获得任何追索权、责备权。", "char_start": 255, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "对方承诺你了的东西，没给你，你可以责备；", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 381}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你自己主动提出的东西，对方不承诺满足，你不可以责备。", "char_start": 382, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这个分际，你必须绝对的咬紧牙关守住。", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这意味着当你在对方既有承诺之外提出任何额外的需求，对方没有接，没有给你新的承诺，你不但绝不能责怪，还要为对方乐意听取、进行了一番思索而表示感谢。", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 500}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为愿意听、愿意思考一下要不要接，本身已经是付出了——如果不是因为你，对方原本不必花费这个精力、被占用这一段生命，不是吗？", "char_start": 501, "char_end": 562}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "为什么要严守这样的界限？", "char_start": 563, "char_end": 575}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这就是为了保证对方不断的获得“倾听需求稳赚不赔”的体验。", "char_start": 576, "char_end": 604}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "只要听了，就算拒绝都有鼓励奖。拒绝也不会有后患可言。", "char_start": 605, "char_end": 631}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "ta绝不可能因为听取了你的需求而导致任何被强加的损失，“拒绝了”得到鼓励奖，要是“接受了又做到了”就得大奖，只有“接受了没做到”才有可能有损失，并且“没做到只要主动抱歉”这个损失还可以获得大幅的减免。", "char_start": 632, "char_end": 732}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这样你才能保证对方有足够的安全感，并对听取你的需求这事保持近乎无条件欢迎的态度。", "char_start": 733, "char_end": 773}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你自己在这方面守得越严，给对方的历史体验越无可挑剔，你自己就会变得对“提需求”这事越来越自信。", "char_start": 774, "char_end": 821}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你可以自信对方对你提需求这事是欢迎的、是乐见的。", "char_start": 822, "char_end": 846}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "答不答应再说，但你说需求不需要再有什么纠结。", "char_start": 847, "char_end": 869}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你不需要恐惧“我要是说了这个让对方为难的需求，对方可能会恨我、跟我吵”。", "char_start": 870, "char_end": 906}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为对方完全确信即使拒绝你也不会怪ta，还会感谢ta愿意给你机会把需求说出来。", "char_start": 907, "char_end": 946}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "那些不敢说需求、说需求也往往结果不好的人呢？则恰恰是违背了这个原则。说出来只要对方不答应，就会摆脸色、发火去惩罚对方。", "char_start": 947, "char_end": 1006}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这就意味着对方听你的需求就有一定概率要么就只能勉强接受指派，打乱自己的计划，要么就会被受到拒绝的你伤害、报复。", "char_start": 1007, "char_end": 1062}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "虽然有时正好合适，可以皆大欢喜，但是作为理性人，人们往往宁可牺牲这偶然的皆大欢喜带来的收益，换取不要隔三差五被伤害一轮的安全。", "char_start": 1063, "char_end": 1126}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "那么为什么这么朴素的道理，人们往往守不住呢？", "char_start": 1127, "char_end": 1149}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "其实是守住了的——你跟陌生人之间、同事之间，往往轻松的守着这个法则，你没注意吗？", "char_start": 1150, "char_end": 1190}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "往往反而是爱人之间、亲子之间、朋友之间守不住。", "char_start": 1191, "char_end": 1214}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这是因为“爱就是默认接受一切请求”这种错误的认识像瘟疫一样四处流行。", "char_start": 1215, "char_end": 1249}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "爱不是一种“默认接受一切请求”的安排，这是错的。", "char_start": 1250, "char_end": 1274}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "爱所默认承担的义务，是“默认给予提出请求的机会”。", "char_start": 1275, "char_end": 1300}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "没有爱的承诺的人，你自动的就知道你没有资格要求别人必须聆听你的需求。看见没，不是没有资格要求对方答应，而是连要求对方听取你的需求的资格都没有，这才是无爱的真正状态。", "char_start": 1301, "char_end": 1383}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "有爱，仅仅只是向前推了一步——“承诺给你提出需求的机会”而已，不包括“必然接受请求”。", "char_start": 1384, "char_end": 1427}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你搞错了这个细节，你就会不断的搞出“提请求然后破坏关系”的事故，直到事故太多，你自己都不敢再提任何要求了。", "char_start": 1428, "char_end": 1481}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "纠正这个错误认知，你就会给人足够的舒适体验，你也就不会再问“该不该提需求”这个问题了。", "char_start": 1482, "char_end": 1525}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 35}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0468"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：需求到底该不该表达?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034"], "summary": "围绕“需求表达困难”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当然要表达，不然对方都不知道你的需求，怎么爱你呢？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当然要表达，不然对方都不知道你的需求，怎么爱你呢？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b4c9e826-7ec6-50e6-8d77-5374de319e03", "source_ordinal": 807, "reading_ordinal": 3250, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "wanted", "published_at": "2025-05-03T23:53:59.234000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1900271409474811272/answer/1902142252865818661"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "经济独立，思想独立，no need.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "No need, so you can want.", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "“需要”是一种软弱， “想要”则是一种强大。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 67}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "“需要”得到了满足，得到的是恩赏和救济，要磨损人格和尊严。", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“想要”得到了满足，得到的是自己主动作为的回报，是对自由和努力的享受。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "自己处理好自己的“需要”（need），然后凭着你自己的能力和筹码，去追求你欲求（want）的一切。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "Don't ever say \"I need you\".", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "I don't need you, and you don't need me.", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "You might think you do, but you don't really. ", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 300}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "You'll see this when I'm gone.", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "I can live without you, happily.", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 365}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "Yes, I really can, no matter who you are or what you are.", "char_start": 366, "char_end": 423}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "And believe me, you can too.", "char_start": 424, "char_end": 452}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "You will see this when I’m gone.", "char_start": 453, "char_end": 485}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "I just want you.", "char_start": 487, "char_end": 503}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "You are wanted, my dear.", "char_start": 504, "char_end": 528}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "Run away if you don’t want to be caught.", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "Run, and you will be free of me.", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 603}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "I am the laziest hunter you will ever meet.", "char_start": 604, "char_end": 647}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "Say no if you only need me.", "char_start": 649, "char_end": 676}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "Say no if you don’t want me.", "char_start": 677, "char_end": 705}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "I want you to want me.", "char_start": 707, "char_end": 729}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "\nAnd believe me,", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 745}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "you want that too.", "char_start": 746, "char_end": 764}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 29}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0468"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女性经济独立、思想独立，那要男人来干什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“wanted”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“经济独立，思想独立，no need.”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "经济独立，思想独立，no need.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8cd3eaca-86e4-5d87-943b-f5839c86ba71", "source_ordinal": 806, "reading_ordinal": 3251, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不为尊严", "published_at": "2025-05-04T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/17daa10e22c711f0a98352540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个定性是错误的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这孩子不是为了自尊把人打了，而是为了建立统治权把人打了。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "为什么这么说？", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为即使最开头是出于自尊受损，正确的手段也是先礼后兵，寻求承担监护责任、秩序维护责任的有关方面来处理问题。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这是正常的、应有的社会调解机制，并且这对懂得如何使用的人而言是一个强大的机制。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "人处理自己权益受损的正道是学会利用这种社会机制来达成自我救济，而不是直接跳过社会秩序机制，直接自己诉诸暴力。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "直接诉诸暴力，意思就是要在社会秩序之外，另外建立一个以自己的暴力为基础的新秩序。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你是为了什么理由走到这一步，其实根本不重要，重要的是你走了这一步，那就不好意思，你已经和社会秩序构成了竞争关系、对立关系。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "一山不能容二虎，同一场域不能实施两套秩序，所以你的孩子的行为必受社会的反制和惩罚。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但这是另一个话题了。", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "关键是——你不要把ta做这事的动机落在“为了自尊”上，因为维护自身尊严是一件正当的事。如果你把这事的动机落在自尊上，那么当ta的行为受到惩罚——如前所述，这是必然的——子女得到的教训必然是“人不能自尊”。", "char_start": 352, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而你如果定性为“尝试依靠暴力建立另一套秩序”，那么当这个行为必然的被惩罚，惩罚造成的教训就会是“人不能凭个人暴力优势尝试推翻社会秩序”，或者至少，不能无策略的、不自量力的这么去做。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 545}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这样正确的定性，才能引导挫折体验沉淀出正确的教训。", "char_start": 546, "char_end": 571}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "同样的道理，恋爱失败，还遭受了经济损失，你就不能定性为“因为追求爱情”，而只能定性为“因为对财务安全原则掉以轻心”。", "char_start": 572, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "总结为前者，那接下来就要准备孤苦一生。", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "总结为后者，那么接下来应该报一个财务培训课程。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 674}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这又是两种截然不同的人生。", "char_start": 675, "char_end": 688}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "不要把教训与正面价值相连，连上了正面价值就会被污毁。这样进行愚蠢的归因，你很快就会被什么“朋友信不得”“漂亮的女人都骗人”“老实没好报”之类乱七八糟的东西包围。", "char_start": 689, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "那你就完了。", "char_start": 770, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "如果你归因为“没有遵循财务原则”“没有坚持合法边界”，那么受了这些挫折你会奋发图强去改善你的知识和技能。", "char_start": 777, "char_end": 829}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "那样你就可以活，还会活得更好。", "char_start": 830, "char_end": 845}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0468"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子被同学辱骂，为了自尊把同学打了怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“不为尊严”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个定性是错误的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个定性是错误的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "fa3f0dd9-ac13-5b17-9269-100fc01cfe5f", "source_ordinal": 805, "reading_ordinal": 3252, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "清洁工休息室", "published_at": "2025-05-05T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/62049d2a238a11f09e1252540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "看似这是个小问题，但实际上却是一个大问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "那就是一家企业到底是在基于一个什么策略在生存的问题——这家企业的基本生存逻辑，是“将自己的成功尽量延续”，还是“将自己的灭亡尽量推迟”？", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 90}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一家成功的企业，刚刚大获全胜，高居细分市场的王座，享受着超额利润。", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个时候，它想的就是如何将我的胜利继续延续。", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而要延续我的胜利，很自然的，第一步就是要延续为我取得这胜利的团队的稳定。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我有超额利润，而且有市场领先的统治地位，钱不是我最关心的问题，但如果我过于吝惜金钱导致我这只下金蛋的鹅营养不良，我就是世界上最蠢的傻瓜。", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而要稳定这支团队，我就势必要提供三个要素：有竞争力的薪酬、健康的工作环境以及延及终身的职业规划。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "有竞争力的薪酬就不说了——谁不想挖赢家的人？这是起码的应对。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "健康的工作环境，就是让员工们觉得不会损害健康和可持续性的、有希望健健康康干下去的环境。而不是一个干一天就病得更重一分、眼见得三五年不辞职就得死在这的这么一个环境。", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 415}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这也是为什么各大厂不约而同的大搞优质员工餐、健身房、按摩师等等保健设施。", "char_start": 416, "char_end": 452}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这自然也包括有尊严的、体面的心理环境——这是指窗明几净的、足够宽敞的工作环境和对员工礼貌、妥帖的对待。", "char_start": 453, "char_end": 504}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "在这种企业里，“保洁人员”，或者更准确的讲——后勤部——会有自己的更衣室和待命休息室。有足够的人手轮班，有足够的专业工具、清洗试剂、防护装具和训练，并且有专业的工作制服。平时不当班的人是便装在休息室待命，当班则要穿上制服、推上工具车去工作区域作业。", "char_start": 505, "char_end": 629}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "工具自有体面的工具间保存，而且有专人维护、保养、更新——事实上这些工具并不便宜廉价，使用起来还需要专业培训指导，否则也维护不了如此华丽精致的办公环境。", "char_start": 630, "char_end": 705}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "正是因为自上而下的贯彻着“最重要的就是把胜利延续下去”的基本逻辑，才能保证这样的工作面貌。", "char_start": 706, "char_end": 751}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这样的企业有一个特点——它一开始就是因为资本看到了巨大的商业机会而果断下注的结果，出手就是为了席卷市场。", "char_start": 752, "char_end": 804}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "是为了赢。", "char_start": 805, "char_end": 810}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这样即使在夺取最初胜利的过程中，资本也绝不允许为了节省一些蝇头小利而拖慢甚至损害取胜的迅猛性。", "char_start": 811, "char_end": 858}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "打赢了，这些细节损失根本不值一提；打输了，节约这点成本根本毫无意义。", "char_start": 859, "char_end": 893}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而这类企业有一个特点——它不会不择手段的延续自己的寿命。", "char_start": 894, "char_end": 922}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "前几年还在大赚特赚，这几年风向变了，前景预期不良了，这些企业背后的资本会宁可趁着企业还有残值迅速出售或者趁着还有残值直接清盘结算。", "char_start": 923, "char_end": 988}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "换言之，它们根本不会等到失败，而是一看“赢不了了”，甚至是“还能赢，但是赢得不够多了”，它们就宁可推倒解散了。", "char_start": 989, "char_end": 1044}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "而不是采用另一个我们更耳熟能详的策略——不惜一切推迟最后的灭亡。", "char_start": 1045, "char_end": 1077}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这就是另一个生存逻辑，即节衣缩食、偷工减料，不断的挑战用户和员工能承受的体验底线，尽可能的熬下去，看能不能熬过冬天，熬到下一个春天和高潮。", "char_start": 1078, "char_end": 1147}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "在这个逻辑下，就会出现“给不了清洁工体面”的问题。", "char_start": 1148, "char_end": 1173}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "而且这个问题是绝对无解的。", "char_start": 1174, "char_end": 1187}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "因为决定这个现象的，是一个全局性的生存战略，要扭转这个现象，需要先颠覆这整个生存逻辑，那绝不是清洁工多一个休息室的问题，而是一个天翻地覆的生存方式的改变。", "char_start": 1188, "char_end": 1265}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这有个很有趣的对比——你可以去上海的高端商场、顶级酒店观察一下，这些地方的后勤部门就相当专业，它们的清洁工人也罢，保安也罢，待遇就相当体面。", "char_start": 1266, "char_end": 1336}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "而这些商场酒店一旦生意不好，又无起色，ta们不会搞“减配降级”，而是直接出售、转卖、清盘结算。", "char_start": 1337, "char_end": 1384}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "反而是中端商场——尤其是主张性价比的那些——就会干一些“把空调关小一点省电、少请几个清洁工省人工、关一半电梯省维护费、喷泉少开点省水”这样的“挣扎求存”的举措。", "char_start": 1385, "char_end": 1465}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这样的商场酒店就容易有一个“缓缓衰败”的过程。", "char_start": 1466, "char_end": 1489}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "而在它竭力“延缓衰老”的每一个阶段，都会出现“清洁工没有体面”的现象。", "char_start": 1490, "char_end": 1525}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "看明白了吗？这是两种经营文化的差别，而不是一个简单的“善待员工”的问题。", "char_start": 1526, "char_end": 1562}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "简单点说——", "char_start": 1563, "char_end": 1569}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "以“争取并尽量延续胜利”逻辑生存的企业，员工才有体面，清洁工才有休息室，但这种企业随时可能裁员或者解散。", "char_start": 1570, "char_end": 1622}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "以“尽量延缓死亡，等待春天”为逻辑的企业，员工备受煎熬，清洁工只能蜷缩角落，但这种企业里核心员工相对不容易失业。", "char_start": 1623, "char_end": 1679}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "注意，不要误以为前一种企业一定比后一种企业有钱。后者也有很多是很有钱的，这跟有钱没钱关系不大，而是一个企业所有者的经营理念问题。", "char_start": 1680, "char_end": 1744}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "仔细掂量清楚你自己要去的是哪一种企业。", "char_start": 1745, "char_end": 1764}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 37}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0468"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待一些保洁人员只能在厕所隔间休息的现象？怎样才能让保洁员有自己的休息室？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037"], "summary": "围绕“清洁工休息室”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“看似这是个小问题，但实际上却是一个大问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "看似这是个小问题，但实际上却是一个大问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "64038e78-7895-5593-a7ed-2f1274b00855", "source_ordinal": 804, "reading_ordinal": 3253, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "可爱", "published_at": "2025-05-05T13:27:53.564000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/449268589/answer/1814695426"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫可爱（lovable）？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我说点最实在、最俗的。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "就是有人爱你，爱得不好，至少不会一翻脸就落得个“罪该万死”的下场。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "人都是无知的，笨拙的，无能的，自私的，贪婪的，并不因为爱你，就变得不无知、不笨拙、不无能、不自私、不贪婪了。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "爱你，也只能是以无知、笨拙、无能、自私、贪婪的方式爱你。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "与其说那是享受，不如说大部分时候都是折磨。", "char_start": 146, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你在万般痛苦之下，仍能宽恕得了，你就是可爱之人。", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "就这么简单。", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "能做到的，必有应分的幸福。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 213}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但是，你知道领到这份幸福的有多少吗？", "char_start": 214, "char_end": 232}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "十不存一。", "char_start": 233, "char_end": 238}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这不是说十个人中只有一个幸运儿，而是说一个人一生中能明悟这条而免于痛苦的平均时间，大多数不到十分之一。", "char_start": 239, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "明白时，往往已将死了。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "一些极为幸运的早悟者争到的余额，都被多得多的一生未悟的人抹平了。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 335}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0468"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：何谓可爱？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“可爱”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫可爱（lovable）？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫可爱（lovable）？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ee0d8558-89f1-5d7c-9980-3be12ce4564d", "source_ordinal": 803, "reading_ordinal": 3254, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "天使杀", "published_at": "2025-05-05T16:04:00.257000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1899209359428399185/answer/1902729465768941487"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "拿到聊天记录或者电话录音直接报警，请警察叔叔直接说服教育一下他，警察叔叔会非常仔细的告知他继续这样干的下一步后果，以及他真的将这些行为付诸行动的后果。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "同时通知他父母，让他父母关注一下自己儿子的状态。你的死活也许他父母不在意，但是他们这宝贝儿子判死刑的可能性他的父母多半是放不下的。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 141}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "通知一下自己的父母，你的父母必然会有所行动。你不知道父母这种动物在子女受到这种死亡威胁之后的勇猛上限是多少。老父亲可能直接搬把凳子坐在他门前蹲守半个月，给你时间搬家。", "char_start": 142, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不必担心父母，父母不会选择为了自己所谓的“安全”让女儿跟这种人来往。", "char_start": 226, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "然后自己换一个地方居住，切断和这个人的一切联系，包括间接联系。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你要认识清楚——反社会者不是你个人的私敌，而是社会公敌。一个人对你发起的挑衅如果带有反社会性质，你有绝对的义务提醒社会的相关力量注视这个隐患，引入社会的力量来压制这些病态的隐患。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "相关部门、对方的社会关系、你的社会关系，是这种社会力量的最小范围。也是社会对反社会行为最典型的免疫机制。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你只是作为“被直接感染的部位”要及时发出信号，调动免疫系统工作起来。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 471}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "解决完具体问题，然后你要反思清楚——如何在早期识别这种行为倾向？", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 505}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "举点例子：在早期接触的时候，就要多拿各类社会案例试探摸索对方的价值观。", "char_start": 506, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "一个人的反社会性是很难一直隐藏的。而反社会性最首要的体现就是对待社会问题的简单粗暴感。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这类人分析社会问题时往往靠臆断来补全自己的论证——如果还谈得上有论证的话，而臆断的方向总是“那个与我类似的角色绝不可能有问题”。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "例如本题下那些断言“这一定是女方对男方欺人太甚导致的”的答案，就是这种经典表现。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 691}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "恰恰是这个“像我一样的人不可能有错”的论证逻辑，是那个“简单粗暴”感的根源。也是同一个逻辑，会轻而易举的诱使当事人认为只要自己不爽，对方就死不足惜。", "char_start": 692, "char_end": 766}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为这个逻辑本身就是一个将自己视为超人类、把别人视为低等生物的表达。", "char_start": 767, "char_end": 801}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "天使当然比凡人高等，凡人触怒天使，天使当然可以击杀凡人。", "char_start": 802, "char_end": 830}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "看明白了吗？", "char_start": 831, "char_end": 837}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "接受教训。", "char_start": 838, "char_end": 843}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0468"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：男朋友说分手就杀了我，还要杀我全家，而且他会开户，他说只要他想他就可以找到我的任何信息，怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“天使杀”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“拿到聊天记录或者电话录音直接报警，请警察叔叔直接说服教育一下他，警察叔叔会非常仔细的告知他继续这样干的下一步后果，以及他真的将这些行为付诸行动的后果。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "拿到聊天记录或者电话录音直接报警，请警察叔叔直接说服教育一下他，警察叔叔会非常仔细的告知他继续这样干的下一步后果，以及他真的将这些行为付诸行动的后果。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 75, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
